    "body": "My guess is that this step was a proper \"fragment case\" before the introduction of `template`.\r\n\r\n```\r\n$ grep -n \"If the second element on the \" source\r\n108812:    <p>If the second element on the <span>stack of open elements</span> is not a <code>body</code>\r\n$ git log -L 108812,+4:source\r\nKilled: 9\r\n```\r\n\r\n...maybe that command works better for someone else with more available disk space.",
